comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-11T23:41:20.016Z",codex,"Duplicate check: exact-title and all-status searches found no canonical item for GitHub issue #120. pmc-vdss addresses UTC timezone drift, not daily clock drift in intentionally tagless packages; pmc-7dm6 covers authoritative tag dates. This open item owns the missing fallback-only contract."
